ing fabrication and assembling limits, optimizing the design of products and reducing the lead time for aircraft development, production and MRO (Vieira and Romero-Torres., 2016). Table 1 (Nyamekye et al., 2023) shows the abilities, benefits and outcomes of the AM of Ti.
